                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The terminite can spend 1 minute to dig a tunnel in reality to or from its extradimensional nest. Non-terminites see this \"tunnel\" as a shimmering sphere of color that occupies a 10-foot sphere. Creatures in the sphere are @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Concealed], and all creatures outside the sphere are concealed from creatures within it. Terminites can pass through the sphere to the nest; for other creatures, the sphere is difficult terrain but doesn't lead anywhere. The tunnel closes after 1 minute. A reality tunnel can be destroyed by dispel magic automatically or by manipulating it with an Interact action and a successful @Check[occultism|dc:16] check.</p>"
